'''''Darth Vader'' 35''' is the thirty-fifth issue of the [[2020]] [[canon]] [[Star Wars comic books|comic book]] series [[Star Wars: Darth Vader (2020)|''Star Wars: Darth Vader'']]. The issue was written by [[Greg Pak]], illustrated by [[Raffaele Ienco]] and [[Federico Blee]], and published by [[Marvel Comics]] on [[June 14]], [[2023]].

==Publisher's summary==
''VADER UNBOUND! The DARK LORD OF THE SITH has called upon the galaxy's greatest archaeologist, DOCTOR APHRA, for help. He's lost control of THE FORCE, and only APHRA knows what can tame his path of destruction&hellip;But will an archaic KYBERITE weapon only lead to more devastation?''

==Opening crawl==
{{OpeningCrawl
|name=TARGET APHRA
|text=After Darth Vader convinced Sabé to fully
commit to the battle against the insurgent
Jul Tambor, Sabé's fellow handmaidens tried
to free her from the Dark Lord's control. But
she returned to Vader, whom only she
knows was once Anakin Skywalker.

Following a deep introspection, Sabé
realized she could not give in to hate and
could never truly join Vader. Vader used his
remaining control of the Force to throw Sabé
far out to sea.

But Vader has a new challenge&mdash;the opening
of the mysterious Fermata Cage has
rendered him unable to fully control his use
of the Force&hellip;.}}

